    "kind": "issue",
    "title": "Dependabot replacement",
    "body": "Hi, \n\nThanks for creating pushin. I moved most of my repo's over from GitHub. But what keeps me from migrating my production repo's is dependabot. I'm addicted to it :D I understand this might not be so easy, but still like to mention it. Also, I wouldn't mind if this was part of a paid plan.\n\nKind regards,\nWouter",
