        },
        "kind": "issue",
        "title": "Releases with downloadable assets",
        "body": "We publish our open-source CLI with goreleaser. On every tag it creates a release and uploads the binaries and a checksums file.\n\nWhat we need:\n - Releases tied to tags, with notes, and a release page in the UI.\n - An API for creating a release and uploading assets. If it follows GitHub's Releases API, goreleaser works unchanged through its github_urls setting.\n - Stable download URLs for assets.",
        "state": "open",
        "stateRaw": "open",
        "isDraft": false,
        "author": {
          "forge": "pushin",
          "instance": "pushin.eu",
          "login": "antoine",
          "id": "u_034NWUr8cxFmBRn6njSdYT",
          "avatarUrl": "https://cdn.pushin.eu/-/avatars/u_034NWUr8cxFmBRn6njSdYT",
          "url": "https://pushin.eu/antoine",
          "typeRaw": "User",
          "isBotHint": false
        },
        "assignees": [],
        "reviewers": [],
        "labels": [],
        "url": "https://pushin.eu/pjullrich/pushin/issues/48",
        "createdAt": "2026-09-27T19:58:30.348Z",
